of its meaning

00:09:43.968 --> 00:09:46.234
Bolton also said
he and Trump have spoken

00:09:46.234 --> 00:09:48.300
about how people have used
burner phones

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.467
to avoid having their calls
scrutinized.

00:09:50.467 --> 00:09:54.167
-I heard him use the term burner
phone a number of times.

00:09:54.167 --> 00:09:58.868
-He said, "Burner phones"
in conversation?

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:01.834
[ Laughter ]
-He did, yes.

00:10:01.834 --> 00:10:02.701
It was a term

00:10:02.701 --> 00:10:04.033
he actually kind of liked.

00:10:04.033 --> 00:10:06.701
He'd say, "You know,
they have these burner phones."

00:10:06.701 --> 00:10:08.868
-Trump always makes it so easy
to contradict him

00:10:08.868 --> 00:10:10.701
by going overboard
with his defense.

00:10:10.701 --> 00:10:13.167
Like if he had just said, "I've
never used a burner phone,"

00:10:13.167 --> 00:10:14.501
that would be harder
to disprove.

00:10:14.501 --> 00:10:16.033
But when he says, "I've never
even heard of the term,"

00:10:16.033 --> 00:10:17.234
a bunch of people
are immediately like,

00:10:17.234 --> 00:10:18.534
"Yeah, no, he has."

00:10:18.534 --> 00:10:20.067
[ Laughter ]
It's like, if your parents said

00:10:20.067 --> 00:10:21.734
they found weed
in your sock drawer

00:10:21.734 --> 00:10:24.033
and your response was,
"What the hell's a sock?!

00:10:24.033 --> 00:10:25.200
[ Laughter ]

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.667
And you keep them in drawers,
you say?

00:10:27.667 --> 00:10:29.200
This is all news to me.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.133
I'm an innocent man,
I tell you!"

00:10:31.133 --> 00:10:33.033
[ Laughter ]
These two episodes

00:10:33.033 --> 00:10:35.000
are deeply revealing,
for many reasons.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.767
For one thing, they show
how the Republican Party

00:10:36.767 --> 00:10:38.901
has been consumed
by its own conspiracy theories.

00:10:38.901 --> 00:10:41.300
It's also very telling
what they're outraged about.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.801
They're furious that a fellow
Republican accused them

00:10:43.801 --> 00:10:45.334
of being
into cocaine and orgies,

00:10:45.334 --> 00:10:47.634
but they don't care
that a former president tried

00:10:47.634 --> 00:10:49.534
to overthrow democracy
and is apparently

00:10:49.534 --> 00:10:51.501
concealing the evidence
about what he did on that day.

00:10:51.501 --> 00:10:53.100
We're missing seven hours

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.534
of Trump's call logs,
during an insurrection.

00:10:55.534 --> 00:10:57.868
Who knows what he was doing
during those seven hours?

00:10:57.868 --> 00:10:59.367
He could've been
orchestrating the coup

00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:00.934
or calling
his various accomplices

00:11:00.934 --> 00:11:01.667
or maybe he was at...

00:11:01.667 --> 00:11:03.067
-A sexual get-together.

00:11:03.067 --> 00:11:04.601
[ Laughter ]
-We don't know.

00:11:10.634 --> 00:11:12.000
[ Laughter ]

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.234
This has been "A Distant Look."

00:11:13.234 --> 00:11:17.033
